        "answer": {
          "short": "$(2,-2.5)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{-2+6}{2}=2\\\\\\bar{y}&=\\frac{-2+(-3)}{2}=-2.5\\\\M&=(2,-2.5)\\end{aligned}$$",
