          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{2.5+4}{2}=3.25\\\\\\bar{y}&=\\frac{3+(-7)}{2}=-2\\\\M&=(3.25,-2)\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
