          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{0.5+5}{2}=2.75\\\\\\bar{y}&=\\frac{0+3}{2}=1.5\\\\M&=(2.75,1.5)\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p5-q3-e",
